        "type": "Text",
        "content": "Our visuals for Seekers (18 to 35) are dynamic, passionate, sometimes even a little chaotic  to  just like life at that age. Diversity isn’t an option here  to  it’s a must. We reflect every type of love, lifestyle and life decision. Joy, heartbreak, excitement, confusion: all have a place. Because home-seeking is human.",
