        "content": "Sound plays a key role in creating emotional connection. Our sonic identity is rooted in real, everyday gestures  to  like sketching, tapping, or marking  to  raw, rhythmic, and human. These elements bring energy to the brand and reflect the creativity that lives in everyday moments, like moving or furnishing a home.",
